===Etymology===
From {{prefix|en|pro|noun}}, modeled on {{der|en|frm|pronom}}, from {{der|en|la|pronomen}}, itself a calque of {{der|en|grc|ᾰ̓ντωνῠμῐ́ᾱ}}.

